WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:08.289
Hi!

00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:09.226
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.336 --> 00:00:10.851
Welcome to 'What to Say'!

00:00:31.772 --> 00:00:35.527
Do you know what to say when you want to persuade someone to do something?

00:00:35.699 --> 00:00:39.971
Listen out for useful language for persuading someone to do something.

00:00:40.102 --> 00:00:43.131
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases 

00:00:43.288 --> 00:00:44.623
after this.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.975
OK.

00:00:46.404 --> 00:00:47.514
Yeah, all right.

00:00:48.253 --> 00:00:49.918
I'll send them over tomorrow.

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:51.661
OK,

00:00:52.341 --> 00:00:53.043
yep,

00:00:53.557 --> 00:00:54.293
bye.

00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:57.350
People are always asking for favours.

00:00:57.368 --> 00:00:58.331
Paul, can you do this?

00:00:58.349 --> 00:00:59.832
Paul, can you do that?

00:01:01.179 --> 00:01:02.142
Hey, Paul,

00:01:02.611 --> 00:01:03.939
have you got a minute?

00:01:04.009 --> 00:01:04.744
Go on, then.

00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:07.666
I've got a small favour to ask you.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:09.220
Right.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.962
So ...

00:01:11.098 --> 00:01:15.169
how you would feel about DJing at the office party next week?

00:01:15.447 --> 00:01:16.523
Office party?

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:19.874
I don't usually do work parties.

00:01:20.742 --> 00:01:21.598
Oh, right!

00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:24.446
So where do you usually DJ then?

00:01:24.628 --> 00:01:28.430
No, I mean I don't usually go to work parties, let alone DJ at them.

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:29.402
Come on,

00:01:29.436 --> 00:01:31.545
I think you'd be brilliant at it!

00:01:31.719 --> 00:01:33.053
Oh, I don't know ...

00:01:33.282 --> 00:01:35.880
Look, I wouldn't usually ask,

00:01:35.947 --> 00:01:38.825
but you are the only DJ I know.

00:01:39.258 --> 00:01:40.990
I'm not a very good one though.

00:01:41.246 --> 00:01:42.779
My music taste is ...

00:01:43.164 --> 00:01:44.482
quite strange.

00:01:44.935 --> 00:01:46.219
Everyone will probably hate it.

00:01:46.315 --> 00:01:51.621
Come on! These guys will dance to anything when they are at a party!

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:53.705
Why don't you give it a go?

00:01:53.731 --> 00:01:54.972
You'll be great!

00:01:55.268 --> 00:01:57.993
Urgh … I think I'm probably busy that day anyway.

00:01:58.124 --> 00:02:00.571
Come on! There's nothing to lose!

00:02:00.624 --> 00:02:03.157
Except my reputation and credibility …

00:02:03.688 --> 00:02:04.595
Paul,

00:02:04.938 --> 00:02:07.005
you'd really be helping me out.

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:08.667
OK,

00:02:08.813 --> 00:02:09.863
I'll think about it.

00:02:10.124 --> 00:02:10.748
Great!

00:02:11.053 --> 00:02:11.912
Thanks, Paul!

00:02:15.028 --> 00:02:16.117
Hello again!

00:02:16.322 --> 00:02:19.195
It's very difficult to say no to Noelia!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:25.233
